#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you are using hinting and have a TTF (not OTF) font which lacks hints but"
" permits you to fork it, you might be able to apply hints using <ulink "
"url=\"https://freetype.org/ttfautohint/\">ttfautohint</ulink> which is based"
" on the old autohinter. As of version 1.8.4 it fails to build without Qt5."
msgstr ""

